@ffmpeg/core is FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org) compiled to WebAssembly together with
libx264, libx265, libvpx, LAME, Opus, Vorbis, Theora, libwebp and other libraries.
Because it includes GPL components (such as x264), the core is distributed under the
GNU General Public License v2 or later. The complete corresponding source code and
build scripts are available at:

  https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/tree/v0.12.10
  https://ffmpeg.org/download.html

The files in vendor/ffmpeg-core/ are the unmodified npm release of @ffmpeg/core 0.12.10.
